Package: paid4
Title: Practical Application to Include future Disease costs (PAID) 4.0
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Elena", "Milkovska", , "milkovska@eshpm.eur.nl", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Pieter", "van Baal", , "vanbaal@eshpm.eur.nl", role = "aut")
  )
Description: PAID 4.0 is a toolkit that enables researchers to incorporate
    future unrelated medical costs and future non-medical costs in their
    economic evaluations.  Users can specify various aspects of their
    intervention to then receive case-specific future unrelated medical
    costs and future non-medical costs.
